sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Coordinator or UI
    participant H as Package host
    participant J as Control and journal
    participant P as Package process
    participant B as Capability broker
    C->>H: Invoke qualified contribution
    H->>J: Check authority and pin version
    J-->>H: Durable operation and invocation token
    H->>P: host.invoke with fixed context
    P->>B: broker.call with token and action key
    B->>J: Recheck control and deduplicate effect
    J-->>B: Admit or return recorded outcome
    B-->>P: Structured outcome
    alt Normal completion
        P-->>H: One terminal result
        H->>J: Persist outcome and release pin
        H-->>C: Saved result and artifacts
    else Cancellation or lost process
        H->>J: Fence further broker effects
        H->>P: host.cancel with bounded deadline
        Note over H,P: Acknowledgement is not proof of stop
        H->>P: Terminate owned tree if needed
        H->>J: Reconcile each admitted operation
        J-->>C: Committed or stopped or Unknown
        Note over C,J: Uncertain mutation blocks dependents only
    end
